  subject:
  - 'Utter Disappointment with gameName '
  - "Decep\xE7\xE3o Total com gameName."
  email:
  - 'Subject: Utter Disappointment with gameName


    Dear members of studioName
    Studio,


    It is with great regret that I write this email to express my profound
    disappointment with the game gameName. I had such high expectations for this
    title, but unfortunately, it fell far short of my hopes.


    I cannot help
    but feel that studioName Studio missed a valuable opportunity to create something
    special with gameName. There seems to have been a lack of care and attention
    to detail in the production of this game, which is extremely disappointing for
    fans of your company.


    I sincerely hope that you take these constructive
    criticisms into consideration and that future projects receive the attention
    and care they deserve.


    With disappointment,


    John Smith

    john.smith@inmail.com'
  - "Assunto: Decep\xE7\xE3o Total com gameName\n\r\nCaros membros do Est\xFAdio
    studioName,\r\n\r\n\xC9 com grande pesar que escrevo este e-mail para expressar
    minha profunda decep\xE7\xE3o com o jogo gameName. Eu tinha expectativas t\xE3o
    altas para este t\xEDtulo, mas, infelizmente, ele n\xE3o atendeu nem de longe
    \xE0s minhas esperan\xE7as.\r\n\r\nN\xE3o posso deixar de sentir que o Est\xFAdio
    studioName perdeu uma oportunidade valiosa de criar algo especial com gameName.
    Parece que houve uma falta de cuidado e aten\xE7\xE3o aos detalhes na produ\xE7\xE3o
    deste jogo, o que \xE9 extremamente decepcionante para os f\xE3s da sua empresa.\r\n\r\nEspero
    sinceramente que voc\xEAs levem essas cr\xEDticas construtivas em considera\xE7\xE3o
    e que futuros projetos recebam a aten\xE7\xE3o e o cuidado que merecem.\r\n\r\nCom
    desapontamento,\r\n\r\nJohn Smith\njohn.smith@inmail.com"
